%---
%[output:405dcb8e]
%   data: {"dataType":"text","outputData":{"text":"Single Phase DAB: DAB_800V\nNominal Power: 225000 [W]\nNormalization Voltage DC1: 800 [V] | Normalization Current DC1: 350 [A]\nNormalization Voltage DC2: 800 [V] | Normalization Current DC2: 350 [A]\nInternal Tank Ls: 2.263537e-05 [H] | Internal Tank Cs: 2.797645e-04 [F]\n---------------------------\n","truncated":false}}
